<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Teacher's Day - Tita Rica</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dff7ec, #fef3c7, #ffe4e6);
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 680px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            border-radius: 32px;
            padding: 32px 28px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            border: 4px solid #33a05b;
            backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
        }

        .top {
            font-size: 42px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #1c7b40;
            font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #d29a00;
            font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.1rem);
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .photo {
            width: min(260px, 70vw);
            height: 290px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 22px;
            border: 6px solid #f3d66b;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
            margin-bottom: 26px;
        }

        .message {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f4fff7, #eefaf2);
            border-radius: 22px;
            padding: 24px 22px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #2f2f2f;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(28, 123, 64, 0.08);
        }

        .message p {
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .message p:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .highlight {
            color: #1c7b40;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .flowers {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin: 20px 0 18px;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
        }

        .signature {
            color: #1c7b40;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        @media (max-width: 500px) {
            .card {
                padding: 24px 18px;
            }

            .message {
                font-size: 0.96rem;
                padding: 18px 14px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="top">🌷📚🍎</div>

        <h1>Happy Teacher's Day!</h1>
        <h2>To My Dear Tita Rica</h2>

        <img src="tita.jpg" alt="Tita Rica" class="photo">

        <div class="message">
            <p>Happy Teacher's Day, Tita Rica! 🌸</p>
            <p>
                Thank you for being such a wonderful teacher who shares not only knowledge,
                but also kindness, patience, and inspiration. <span class="highlight">💚</span>
            </p>
            <p>
                Your guidance and love make learning brighter and life more meaningful.
                You are truly a teacher worth appreciating every single day.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flowers">🌻 🌷 🌸 🌼 🌺</div>

        <p class="signature">
            With love and appreciation,<br>
            Your Niece/Nephew 💕
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
